{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09243","headline":"将发楚州经宝应县访李二忽於州馆相遇月夜书事因简李宝应 · 韦应物","name":"将发楚州经宝应县访李二忽於州馆相遇月夜书事因简李宝应","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤舟欲夜发，祗爲访情人。\n此地忽相遇，留连意更新。\n停杯嗟别久，对月言家贫。\n一问临邛令，如何待上宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}